flowchart LR
  A[Issue or task] --> B[Feature branch from main]
  B --> C[Commits using Conventional Commits]
  C --> D[Pull request to main]
  D --> E[CI: Checkstyle, JUnit tests, Maven package]
  E -->|Pass| F[Teammate review and approval]
  E -->|Fail| B
  F -->|Changes requested| B
  F -->|Approved and conversations resolved| G[Squash merge to protected main]
  G --> H[Release candidate]
  H --> I[Version tag and approved production deployment]
